    "id": "rw-c1-p14",
    "type": "verse",
    "num": "§ 14",
    "original": "There has fallen a splendid tear\nFrom the passion-flower at the gate.\nShe is coming, my dove, my dear—",
    "zh": "一滴璀璨的泪珠悄然坠落，\n自大门口的西番莲花间。\n她来了，我的白鸽，我的心爱——"
